                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=352571'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=18642463&name=394-229-9768-002MuslimChaplainDutyStatement.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

            </div>

